        {
          "id": "utrecht-note",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Rotterdam was mostly for meeting a family friend, but we did get to see a side of the Netherlands that featured more modern architecture in this major port city. \n\nIn Utrecht we completed the infamous \"Dome\" escape room at Mama Bazooka's. If you're an escape room fanatic, the Netherlands will certainly not disappoint. (My phone remained feebly charged, so pictures were sparse on these quick trips.)",
